{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23354","headline":"宿荥阳 · 白居易","name":"宿荥阳","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"生长在荥阳，少小辞乡曲。\n迢迢四十载，复向荥阳宿。\n去时十一二，今年五十六。\n追思儿戏时，宛然犹在目。\n旧居失处所，故里无宗族。\n岂唯变市朝，兼亦迁陵谷。\n独有溱洧水，无情依旧绿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23354.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23354","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}